@api = http://localhost:5126

### Environment label, languages, capabilities
GET {{api}}/api/v1/system/info

### Sign in to the demo account (copy accessToken into @token)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "device": { "installationId": "http-file-device", "platform": "cli", "label": "http file" } }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Welcome (starts or resumes the conversation)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/conversation?language=en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Say something (typed). Use the conversationId from the welcome reply.
POST {{api}}/api/v1/conversation/turns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "turnId": "http-turn-0001", "language": "en", "text": "Send 50 cedis to Ama", "inputMode": "text" }

### History
GET {{api}}/api/v1/transactions?language=en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Presenter: reset the demo
POST {{api}}/api/v1/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
